          "en": "You find it attached.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.26,
          "end": 11.57,
          "en": "And there I already have a simple Vue app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.57,
          "end": 13.67,
          "en": "created with create app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.67,
          "end": 16.22,
          "en": "where we have two pieces of data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.22,
          "end": 19.15,
          "en": "the current user input and the message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.15,
          "end": 21.31,
          "en": "where we have two methods.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.31,
          "end": 23.88,
          "en": "One to change the current user input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.88,
          "end": 25.9,
          "en": "to the event target value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.9,
          "end": 27.756,
          "en": "And one to set the current message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.756,
          "end": 29.77,
          "en": "to the current user input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 29.77,
          "end": 33.89,
          "en": "And all of that is connected to some HTML code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.89,
          "end": 37.35,
          "en": "That is the section we're controlling with Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.35,
          "end": 40.67,
          "en": "This is what triggers to save input method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.67,
          "end": 43.4,
          "en": "Here we triggered a set text method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.4,
          "end": 45.68,
          "en": "and here we output the message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.68,
          "end": 47.26,
          "en": "And then we've got some styles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 47.26,
          "end": 49.16,
          "en": "which we of course can ignore though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 49.16,
          "end": 53.333,
          "en": "These are largely the styles you already know anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.3,
          "end": 57.03,
          "en": "Now this app here is very simple,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.03,
          "end": 59.38,
          "en": "Vue is awesome is something I can enter here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.38,
          "end": 62.83,
          "en": "And if I click set text, that's the message showing up here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 62.83,
          "end": 67.83,
          "en": "And that is achieved with a combination of data methods",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 68.81,
          "end": 71.07,
          "en": "and then of course, event bindings",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.07,
          "end": 72.45,
          "en": "that triggered the methods",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 72.45,
          "end": 76.31,
          "en": "and interpolation to output the message data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 76.31,
          "end": 79.2,
          "en": "Now, that's all something you'll learn about in this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 79.2,
          "end": 83.28,
          "en": "and I'm not going to bore you by repeating this again here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.28,
          "end": 86.3,
          "en": "If that is still unclear, you should go through",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.3,
          "end": 88.803,
          "en": "the previous lectures and modules again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.86,
          "end": 91.75,
          "en": "Now, what I wanna explore here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 91.75,
          "end": 95.22,
          "en": "is how Vue does this behind the scenes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.22,
          "end": 98.09,
          "en": "This automatic updating here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.09,
          "end": 100.8,
          "en": "If we changed the text here and set it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 100.8,
          "end": 105.8,
          "en": "this part of the page, we as a user see, is updated by Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 107.15,
          "end": 112.15,
          "en": "And that's this built in reactivity, which Vue has,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.15,
          "end": 114.49000000000001,
          "en": "which is one of its core features.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 114.49000000000001,
          "end": 117.36,
          "en": "Essentially viewed as one important thing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 117.36,
          "end": 122.36,
          "en": "The data you define here is something Vue keeps track of.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 123.05,
          "end": 127.2,
          "en": "I mentioned before that it would take this data object here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 127.2,
          "end": 132.2,
          "en": "and merge all your properties in here into a global",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.5,
          "end": 135.84,
          "en": "behind the scenes managed object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 135.84,
          "end": 138.67000000000002,
          "en": "the same object where your methods",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.67000000000002,
          "end": 140.543,
          "en": "are merged into by the way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 141.86,
          "end": 143.82,
          "en": "And indeed, this is what is happening",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 143.82,
          "end": 145.63,
          "en": "behind the scenes by Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 145.63,
          "end": 148.11,
          "en": "It also does other things like ensuring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 148.11,
          "end": 152.3,
          "en": "that this points at this global object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 152.3,
          "end": 154.1,
          "en": "but when it comes to the data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 154.1,
          "end": 157.473,
          "en": "the important and key thing which Vue does",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 157.473,
          "end": 162.473,
          "en": "is it turns your data object into a reactive data object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 163.9,
          "end": 167.39,
          "en": "by essentially wrapping your properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 167.39,
          "end": 170.81,
          "en": "with a JavaScript feature called Proxies.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 170.81,
          "end": 173.17000000000002,
          "en": "in JavaScript there's a built in feature,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 173.17000000000002,
          "end": 175.09,
          "en": "which is called Proxy,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 175.09,
          "end": 177.89,
          "en": "which Vue leverages under the hood",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 177.89,
          "end": 182.59,
          "en": "to wrap your properties here and to be notified",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 182.59,
          "end": 185.26,
          "en": "whenever you assign a new value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 185.26,
          "end": 187.2,
          "en": "like here with message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 187.2,
          "end": 190.12,
          "en": "When I set a new value to message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 190.12,
          "end": 192.794,
          "en": "no matter if data is another data property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 192.794,
          "end": 196.2,
          "en": "or a hard coded string like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 196.2,
          "end": 201.2,
          "en": "no matter what it is, when you assign a new value to message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 201.36,
          "end": 205.02,
          "en": "Vue is made aware of that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 205.02,
          "end": 206.37,
          "en": "And that's important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 206.37,
          "end": 210.78,
          "en": "If Vue would not be notified about this new assignment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 210.78,
          "end": 214.96,
          "en": "it could not go ahead and update what you see on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 214.96,
          "end": 218.06,
          "en": "It needs to be notified by changes like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 218.06,
          "end": 221.21,
          "en": "so that it recognizes that it should scan",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 221.21,
          "end": 224.14,
          "en": "the controlled HTML code for a use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 224.14,
          "end": 226.74,
          "en": "such as ofted changed property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 226.74,
          "end": 229.25,
          "en": "like here, messages being used here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 229.25,
          "end": 232.02,
          "en": "And then when it sees those usages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 232.02,
          "end": 234.31,
          "en": "and it knows that message changed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 234.31,
          "end": 236.8,
          "en": "it goes out to the rendered page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 236.8,
          "end": 238.54,
          "en": "to the screen the user sees,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 238.54,
          "end": 240.4,
          "en": "it goes to that screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 240.4,
          "end": 243.33,
          "en": "and finds the appropriate place there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 243.33,
          "end": 246.7,
          "en": "where this dynamic content is displayed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 246.7,
          "end": 249.55,
          "en": "and updated there on the screen as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 249.55,
          "end": 251.85,
          "en": "And that's this built in reactivity,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 251.85,
          "end": 255.283,
          "en": "which Vue does and uses behind the scenes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 256.25,
          "end": 257.95,
          "en": "Now, how does that work though?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 257.95,
          "end": 262.27,
          "en": "I mentioned that a feature called Proxies would be used.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 262.27,
          "end": 264.493,
          "en": "Let's explore data in greater detail.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
